    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (reflexion)
  entry
    definition "expression without words"
    examples ("tears are an expression of grief" "the pulse is a reflection of the heart's condition")
    id oewn-06893299-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (expression manifestation reflexion)
  entry
    definition "a likeness in which left and right are reversed"
    id oewn-04754355-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms ("mirror image" reflexion)
  entry
    definition "the image of something as reflected by a mirror (or other reflective material)"
    examples ("he studied his reflection in the mirror")
    id oewn-04076088-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (reflexion)
  entry
    definition "(mathematics) a transformation in which the direction of one axis is reversed"
    id oewn-13807616-n
    partOfSpeech n
  entry
    definition "a remark expressing careful consideration"
    id oewn-06779826-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (observation reflexion)
